## 🔍 ESLint Configuration

### Enabled Rules
```json
{
  "@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any": "warn",
  "@typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-assignment": "warn",
  "@typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-member-access": "warn",
  "@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars": "error",
  "@typescript-eslint/explicit-function-return-type": "warn",
  "@typescript-eslint/no-floating-promises": "error",
  "no-console": "warn",
  "prefer-const": "error"
}
```

### When to Suppress
```typescript
// ✅ Acceptable: Type assertion when parsing external data
const data = JSON.parse(message) as OrderCreatedEvent;

// ✅ Acceptable: Suppress for workspace compatibility
// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any
KafkaConsumerModule.forRoot(config) as any;

// ❌ Bad: Suppressing without reason
// eslint-disable-next-line
const data: any = getValue();
```

