## 📋 Code Review Checklist

### Before Committing
- [ ] All linting errors fixed (`pnpm lint:fix`)
- [ ] Code formatted (`pnpm format`)
- [ ] Tests passing (`pnpm test`)
- [ ] No `console.log` statements (use `logger`)
- [ ] No hardcoded values
- [ ] Error handling in place
- [ ] Types explicit (no `any` unless suppressed with reason)
- [ ] Documentation added for complex logic

### PR Review Points
- [ ] Architecture aligned with established patterns
- [ ] No breaking changes (or documented)
- [ ] Database migrations if schema changed
- [ ] Tests cover new functionality
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] Performance considered
- [ ] Security implications reviewed
- [ ] Backward compatibility maintained

